int about Client.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; color: black;\">Brand Ambassador may not reach out to any third-party photographer or any other servicers met through the Client without written consent from Client.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; word-spacing: 0px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; color: black;\">INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY-</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; color: black;\">&nbsp;The Influencer grants the Company a non-exclusive, royalty-free, worldwide license to use, reproduce, and distribute the Content for marketing and promotional purposes.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; word-spacing: 0px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; color: black;\">Ownership</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; color: black;\">- The Influencer retains ownership of the Content created under this Agreement<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial